{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pVyiS8sYxj1795181813.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>深圳舉辦的亞太經合組織(APEC)領導人非正式會議結束後一日，國家主席習近平與新加坡總理黃循財會面，提到兩國要做引領創新的發展夥伴。</p><p></p><p>國家主席習近平稱：「作為友好近鄰和重要發展夥伴，中新雙方要把握時代潮流，加上戰略溝通，增進團結協作，推動中新全方位高質量的前瞻性夥伴關係，不斷地能夠邁上新台階。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.521846+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T13:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T15:57:17.151727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T14:17:19.408720+00:00","content_hash":"eb422fbff2adc3da36d8c59abe049efe34fadd3b4df735aa8ea2226156e75ad8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T14:23:58.521846+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}